  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞“不可思议之国的你”前……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:0:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞善和直斗正望着迷宫里面……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 02 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 15 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 70 0D}啊……是你。\n要出发了吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}为什么在这里？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:2:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}刚才在想什么？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 0D 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 42 06}我们正在聊迷宫的事。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 01 01 03 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}这所学校是玲的“理想之地”……\n为了不让她接触死亡的真相，\n才出现了迷宫和看守……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:4:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那么，为什么迷宫\n会以爱丽丝和联谊等形式出现呢？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:4:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}鬼屋里出现的\n是学校与医院。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:4:3",
  "message_id": "MSG_0032",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}而写给玲的留言卡，\n那份决定性的“死亡证据”，\n却出现在祭典活动里……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 15 01 07 01 05 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 B7 0D}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "SEL_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 02 01 01 01 01 01}什么意思？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 09 01 21 01}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:6:1",
  "message_id": "SEL_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}善知道吗？{F5 47 02 01 03 01 01 01 21 01}{00}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}不知道……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:7:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}我……什么都不知道。\n即使找回了记忆，\n我依然无法理解玲的心情……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:7:2",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:8:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 09 01 11 01 02 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}如果……真像我想的那样，\n那就实在……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:8:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_007",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}……太悲伤了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e900/e905_240.bf.json:9:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_008",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
